cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Starspin, please cite this software."
type: software
title: "Starspin: A GPU correlator for LAMBDA telescope commissioning"
url: "https://github.com/jdgsmallwood/cuda-spatial-filtering"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jdgsmallwood/cuda-spatial-filtering"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Starspin ingests LAMBDA FPGA packet streams or recorded PCAP files,
  aligns and optionally channelizes antenna voltages, and produces
  integrated full-polarization visibilities with capture provenance.
  It is used for commissioning the LAMBDA telescope.
keywords:
  - radio astronomy
  - GPU computing
  - CUDA
  - correlator
  - telescope commissioning
